{"id":4,"slug":"4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?","question_en":"What does the basic structure of an HTML document consist of?","answer_vi":"Một tài liệu HTML tối thiểu gồm bốn phần:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>            <!-- render mode -->\n<html lang=\"vi\">           <!-- root element, lang cho screen reader + dịch tự động -->\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Tiêu đề tab</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Nội dung hiển thị</h1>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n- `<!DOCTYPE html>` — bật standards mode.\n- `<html>` — phần tử gốc; `lang` ảnh hưởng trực tiếp tới screen reader và Google Translate.\n- `<head>` — metadata, không hiển thị: `<title>`, `<meta>`, `<link>`, `<script>`.\n- `<body>` — toàn bộ nội dung người dùng nhìn thấy.\n\n**Lưu ý:** `<meta charset>` phải nằm trong **1024 byte đầu** của tài liệu, nếu không browser đã đoán encoding xong rồi và tiếng Việt hiện thành ký tự lỗi.","answer_en":"A minimal HTML document has four parts:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>            <!-- render mode -->\n<html lang=\"en\">           <!-- root element; lang drives screen readers and auto-translation -->\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Tab title</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Visible content</h1>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n- `<!DOCTYPE html>` — switches on standards mode.\n- `<html>` — the root element; `lang` directly affects screen readers and Google Translate.\n- `<head>` — metadata that is never rendered: `<title>`, `<meta>`, `<link>`, `<script>`.\n- `<body>` — everything the user actually sees.\n\n**Note:** `<meta charset>` has to appear within the **first 1024 bytes**, otherwise the browser has already guessed an encoding and non-ASCII text renders as mojibake.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Một tài liệu HTML tối thiểu gồm bốn phần:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;            &lt;!-- render mode --&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;vi&quot;&gt;           &lt;!-- root element, lang cho screen reader + dịch tự động --&gt;\n  &lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Tiêu đề tab&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;/style.css&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;/head&gt;\n  &lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;Nội dung hiển thị&lt;/h1&gt;\n  &lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- render mode --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;vi&quot;</span>&gt;</span>           <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- root element, lang cho screen reader + dịch tự động --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;viewport&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>Tiêu đề tab<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">link</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rel</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/style.css&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Nội dung hiển thị<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</code> — bật standards mode.</li><li><code>&lt;html&gt;</code> — phần tử gốc; <code>lang</code> ảnh hưởng trực tiếp tới screen reader và Google Translate.</li><li><code>&lt;head&gt;</code> — metadata, không hiển thị: <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;link&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>.</li><li><code>&lt;body&gt;</code> — toàn bộ nội dung người dùng nhìn thấy.</li></ul><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>&lt;meta charset&gt;</code> phải nằm trong <strong>1024 byte đầu</strong> của tài liệu, nếu không browser đã đoán encoding xong rồi và tiếng Việt hiện thành ký tự lỗi.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>A minimal HTML document has four parts:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;            &lt;!-- render mode --&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;           &lt;!-- root element; lang drives screen readers and auto-translation --&gt;\n  &lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Tab title&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;/style.css&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;/head&gt;\n  &lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;Visible content&lt;/h1&gt;\n  &lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- render mode --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span>           <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- root element; lang drives screen readers and auto-translation --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;viewport&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>Tab title<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">link</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rel</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/style.css&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Visible content<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</code> — switches on standards mode.</li><li><code>&lt;html&gt;</code> — the root element; <code>lang</code> directly affects screen readers and Google Translate.</li><li><code>&lt;head&gt;</code> — metadata that is never rendered: <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;link&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>.</li><li><code>&lt;body&gt;</code> — everything the user actually sees.</li></ul><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> <code>&lt;meta charset&gt;</code> has to appear within the <strong>first 1024 bytes</strong>, otherwise the browser has already guessed an encoding and non-ASCII text renders as mojibake.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — HTML document structure","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Basic_HTML_syntax"},{"label":"HTML Standard — the html element","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-html-element"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inline-element-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao-trong-html","title":"Block-level element và Inline element khác nhau như thế nào trong HTML?"},{"url":"/q/12-html-attribute-thuoc-tinh-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"HTML Attribute (thuộc tính) là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/13-boolean-attribute-trong-html-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Boolean attribute trong HTML là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/14-custom-data-attribute-data-trong-html-la-gi","title":"Custom data attribute (data-*) trong HTML là gì?"},{"url":"/q/15-thuoc-tinh-id-va-class-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Thuộc tính `id` và `class` khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"}]}